codex
The first compiled semantics exposed a sequencing bug during `krun`: the generic list-decomposition rule could decompose a singleton statement forever. I’ve isolated it to the statement-list machinery and am replacing that rule with head-and-tail rules per statement form, which gives each rewrite a strict progress measure.
